{{Documentation}}
Important note: for big templates it's better to just put <pre>
{{#invoke:Navbox|main
|arg1 = ...
...
}}
</pre>
Rather than
<pre>
{{Navbox
|arg1 = ...
...
}}
</pre>

This saves space from the "post-expand include size". This is because parser functions like <code>#invoke</code> double the PEIS for some reason.

Alternatively, {{t|HiddenNavbox}} is hidden by default and is instead loaded with js.

See [[wgg:RANGER navboxes]] for the actual docs. Original template is [[wgg:defaultloadout:Template:Navbox]].

== Basic example ==
The following example demonstrates the core functionality of this template: the title text, one standard link group, and one link group that contains two sub-groups. The rows are striped for easier readability.

{{Navbox
| template = Navbox/doc

| title = Items
| striped = even

| group1 = Consumables
| list1 =
* Health Potion
* Mana Potion

| group2 = Weapons

| group2.1 = Swords
| list2.1 =
* Wooden Sword
* Rusted Sword
* Steel Sword

| group2.2 = Bows
| list2.2 =
* Shortbow
* Crossbow
* Longbow
}}

